er 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: a pile-up of amounts just under the limit is a statistical indicator. It does not prove that any contract was broken up or that anyone acted improperly; it may reflect market prices, fixed budgets or separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["Rvg7w8K%2F%2FT%2Bzz8fXU2i3eQ%3D%3D","jZNpYAqKRgLECtSnloz%2BZQ%3D%3D","q1dSLXND2Hr%2Fa9DgO%2BoYKQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}